# ============================================================
# Wellpack Industries — Environment Variables
# ============================================================
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to:  .env.local
# 2. Fill in your Anthropic API key below
# 3. NEVER commit .env.local to git (it's in .gitignore)
# ============================================================

# Get your key from: https://console.anthropic.com
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# ⚠️  IMPORTANT — Production Warning:
# Exposing an API key in the browser (VITE_ prefix) is fine for
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT only. For production deployment, you MUST
# route API calls through a backend proxy:
#   - Next.js API route
#   - Express.js server
#   - Cloudflare Worker
#   - Vercel serverless function
# This protects your key from being stolen by users.
